flowchart LR
  U[Researcher or approved event] --> T[Trigger intake]
  T --> R[Taskmaster router]
  R --> Q[Durable task queue]
  Q --> W[GroundPulse worker]
  W --> A[Approved source adapters]
  A --> S[(Immutable source snapshots)]
  S --> V[Evidence validator]
  V --> G{Evidence gate}
  G -->|Accepted| P[Research package]
  G -->|Unsupported or missing| H[Human review queue]
  P --> D[Dashboard and artifact delivery]

  subgraph GCP_Target[Target GCP services]
    T
    R
    Q
    W
    S
    V
    P
  end

  T -. Cloud Run API .- R
  Q -. Cloud Tasks .- W
  S -. Cloud Storage .- V
  R -. Pub/Sub for approved events .- Q
  P -. Cloud Storage PDF and JSON .- D
